@startuml 09-payment-state-machine

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12

[*] --> Pending : create intent

Pending --> RequiresAction : 3D Secure / SCA required
Pending --> Processing : payment method attached
Pending --> Canceled : cancel intent

RequiresAction --> Processing : customer authenticates
RequiresAction --> Canceled : authentication fails

Processing --> Succeeded : charge succeeds
Processing --> Failed : charge fails

Succeeded --> Captured : capture funds
Succeeded --> Canceled : cancel (before capture)

Captured --> Refunded : refund payment
Captured --> [*] : fulfillment complete

Failed --> [*] : retry or abandon
Canceled --> [*] : order canceled
Refunded --> [*] : money returned

note right of Succeeded
  System maintains its own
  PaymentIntent state in parallel
  with Stripe's state to support
  the Bogus test gateway and
  enable offline operations.
end note

@enduml
